<h2 id="ha-ctrl-008-acceptance">Acceptance checks</h2>

1. Use the same friendly name in different areas, translated names and long identifiers. The chosen entity IDs must stay correct after sorting or filtering.
2. Test no results, a registry failure, an unavailable entity and a deleted saved entity one at a time. Nothing is replaced or deleted automatically.
3. Choose mixed target types with an exclusion and round-trip the native value without losing fields or widening the scope.
4. Search, select and remove by keyboard, and check where focus goes after the last item is removed. Test an authorised and a restricted account without exposing hidden data.

Source review and these checks do not prove an accessible result on a real device. Record the versions, browser, input, expected and observed results and where the evidence is kept. Note any native limits you could not resolve.

